  "ruleText": "Ahp 219.01 Procedure for Voluntary Surrender of License. Any licensee wishing to surrender his or her license shall submit to the appropriate governing board a written statement of voluntary surrender of license.\n\nSource. #8079, eff 5-1-04; EXPIRED: 5-1-12\n\nNew. #10143-B, eff 6-7-12",
